 "response": {
  "text": "Haan, **₹2,000 ke andar** men’s jeans ke liye main ye brands prefer karunga:\n\n### [Levi's Men's 511 Slim Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,279*\n\n### [Pepe Jeans Men Straight Fit Blue Jeans]()\n*₹1,631.15*\n\n### [Flying Machine Men's Slim Fit Jeans]()\n*₹999*\n\n### [Pepe Jeans Men's Holborne Mid Rise Straight Jeans]()\n*₹1,359.15*\n\n### [Roadster Men's Loose Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,080*\n\n### Meri ranking 👖\n\n1. **Levi’s — Best overall** ⭐  \n   Sale mein ₹1,300–₹2,000 ke aas-paas mil jaye to **Levi’s sabse achha pick** hai. Official store par abhi 513 aur 512 jaise models ₹1,679 ke around listed hain. [levi.in](https://levi.in/collections/men-jeans?filter.v.availability=1&utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n2. **Pepe Jeans — Best value**  \n   ₹1,400–₹2,000 mein kaafi achhe **straight/slim fits** mil rahe hain. Pepe ki official site par multiple jeans ₹1,499–₹1,999 ke range mein hain. [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/men/jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n3. **Flying Machine — Budget + daily wear**  \n   ₹900–₹1,500 mein achhi choice. Agar ₹2,000 poore spend nahi karne hain, ye strong option hai. [magicpin.in](https://magicpin.in/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n4. **Roadster — Cheapest decent option**  \n   Generally ₹600–₹1,500 ke aas-paas; casual/college wear ke liye theek. [magicpin.in](https://magicpin.in/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n5. **Spykar — Stretch/comfort ke liye**  \n   Sale mein ₹1,500–₹2,000 ke andar mil sakti hai; daily use ke liye comfortable option. [magicpin.in](https://magicpin.in/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Agar mujhe ₹2,000 mein sirf 1 leni ho:**  \n👉 **Levi’s 511/513** — sale price ≤₹2,000 mile to.  \n👉 Nahi mile, to **Pepe Jeans straight fit** lo.\n\nAgar tum mujhe **apni age, height, weight aur waist size (jaise 32)** bata do, main tumhare body type ke hisaab se **exact fit (slim/straight/relaxed) aur 3–5 best jeans** ₹2,000 ke andar choose kar sakta hoon.",
